REM keymap_test.duck [UTILITY] - types every letter, digit and symbol so you can
REM confirm the target receives them correctly (no dropped/mistyped chars). If
REM something looks wrong, raise inter_key_delay_ms or check the keyboard layout.
REM Open Notepad (or focus any text field) first.
DELAY 800
GUI r
DELAY 600
STRINGLN notepad
DELAY 1800
DEFAULTDELAY 8
STRINGLN the quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog
STRINGLN THE QUICK BROWN FOX JUMPS OVER THE LAZY DOG
STRINGLN 0123456789
STRINGLN `~!@#$%^&*()-_=+[]{}\|;:'",.<>/?
STRINGLN if every character above looks right, your keymap/layout is good.
